## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=style/useFilenamingConvention FooBar.vue
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "linter": { "enabled": true },
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true
  },
  "linter": { "rules": { "style": { "useFilenamingConvention": "error" } } }
}
```

## `FooBar.vue`

```vue
<script>
export default {};
</script>

<script setup>
const a = 1;
</script>

<template>
  <span>{{ a }}</span>
</template>

```

